[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine_lite/lib/dag_engine_lite_impl.py: Implement the concrete DAG execution engine: DAG maintains _nodes/_upstream/_downstream adjacency with deferred missing-dependency detection in validate(), DFS cycle detection reporting cycle sequences, priority-then-lexicographic deterministic topological sort, root/leaf discovery, and weighted longest-path critical path; WaveScheduler synchronizes state against DAG.all_nodes() (purging removed nodes, initializing roots READY/others PENDING and promoting unblocked dependents) and applies FAIL_FAST/CONTINUE_ON_ERROR/SKIP_DOWNSTREAM policies; DAGRunner validates invariants first, dispatches ready waves sequentially, executes retries, records NodeResult outcomes with durations, and returns a consolidated DAGRunReport with critical path.
